# 统一按 LF 入库。之前没有这份文件，core.autocrlf 让仓库里 LF / CRLF 混着，
# 两份内容相同的镜像文件 diff 会报几十行不同。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.kt text eol=lf
*.kts text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.pro text eol=lf
*.properties text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
gradlew text eol=lf
gradlew.bat text eol=crlf
*.jar binary
*.png binary
*.webp binary
